@page "/about"

<div class="container mt-3 text-center">
    <div class="card shadow-sm p-2 p-md-4 mx-auto" style="max-width: 600px;">
        <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
            <img src="/icon-192.png" alt="Habit Tracker Logo" class="img-fluid me-3" style="max-width: 140px;" />

            <div>
                <h1 class="fw-bold mb-1">Habit Tracker</h1>
                <p class="text-muted mb-0">Version: 1.0.250404</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <p class="lead">
            Habit Tracker is a simple yet powerful application that helps you build and maintain daily habits.
            Set goals, track your progress, and stay consistent on your journey to self-improvement.
        </p>

        <p class="small text-secondary">
            &copy; @DateTime.Now.Year Habit Tracker. All rights reserved.
        </p>

        <hr />
        <p class="small">
            We provide free productivity tools. While these tools will remain free forever, we do accept donations
            if you find them personally helpful. Donations will go towards running the apps and services on better
            hardware infrastructure to provide users a faster experience.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center"><DonateButton /></div>

        <hr />
        <p class="small">
            External book links in Habit Tracker use Amazon Affiliate links as a secondary income stream to 
            get some payments based on book purchases made by our users.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
